WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A NAME IS NOT A VERIFIED PRODUCT RECORD. A familiar label does not supply verified identity, composition, quality, effect or safety.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
OPEN THE FICTIONAL RECORD. Compare declared name, format and relative bands while keeping missing evidence visible.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
FIELDS ARE NOT FINDINGS. Changing a comparison reorganizes fields; it does not create equivalence or fit.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
PRESERVE THE GAPS. No laboratory result, verified label, dose, batch, person or current law is represented.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
COMPARE—DO NOT RECOMMEND. The demo cannot rank, match, predict, guide purchase or interpret a certificate.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
LOOK BEYOND THE NAME. A responsible comparison begins by showing which evidence is still missing.
